1. Heat the food in the microwave.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (heated food)
   )
   ```

2. Move the heated food to the living room desk.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on food desk)
   )
   ```

3. Move the water bottle to the living room desk.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on water_bottle desk)
   )
   ```

4. Store the eggs in the egg container.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_in_container eggs egg_container)
   )
   ```